Business metrics track business outcomes (orders, revenue), technical metrics track system health (latency, errors). Combine for complete picture. Implementation:

@Service
public class OrderService {
  private final MeterRegistry registry;

  // Technical metrics
  private final Timer orderProcessingTime;
  private final Counter orderFailures;

  // Business metrics  
  private final Counter ordersCreated;
  private final DistributionSummary orderValue;
  private final Gauge activeOrders;

  public OrderService(MeterRegistry registry) {
    this.registry = registry;

    // Technical
    this.orderProcessingTime = Timer.builder("order.processing.time")
      .publishPercentiles(0.95, 0.99)
      .register(registry);

    // Business
    this.ordersCreated = Counter.builder("business.orders.created")
      .description("Total orders created")
      .tag("channel", "web")
      .register(registry);

    this.orderValue = DistributionSummary.builder("business.order.value")
      .description("Order value distribution")
      .baseUnit("USD")
      .publishPercentiles(0.5, 0.95, 0.99)
      .register(registry);
  }

  public Order createOrder(OrderRequest request) {
    return orderProcessingTime.record(() -> {
      try {
        Order order = processOrder(request);

        // Business metrics
        ordersCreated.increment();
        orderValue.record(order.getTotalAmount());
        registry.counter("business.revenue.total",
          "currency", "USD"
        ).increment(order.getTotalAmount());

        // Segment by customer type
        registry.counter("business.orders.by.customer.type",
          "type", request.getCustomer().getType()
        ).increment();

        return order;
      } catch (Exception e) {
        orderFailures.increment();
        throw e;
      }
    });
  }
}

Grafana dashboard combines:
- Technical: P99 latency, error rate, throughput
- Business: Orders per minute, revenue per hour, average order value, conversion rate

Alerts on business metrics: revenue drop > 20%, order rate < 10/min. Correlate: latency spike causes order drop. Business metrics justify technical investments.
